OL,4,CLock of former US President George     
OL,5,CWashington's hair sells for $4,000     
OL,6,GA framed lock of hair from America's   
OL,7,Gfirst president, George Washington,    
OL,8,Ghas been sold at auction for $4,000    
OL,9,G(#3,058).                              
OL,11,FThe hair once belonged to John Gadsby, 
OL,12,Fwho entertained Washington in 1799     
OL,13,Fjust before the latter's death the     
OL,14,Fsame year, and was later obtained by a 
OL,15,Fcollector called John K Lattimer from  
OL,16,Fa descendent of Gadsby's, according to 
OL,17,FRichmond Auctions, which sold the item.
OL,19,FIts new owner has not been named.      
